# The tools CI and `make check` run that go.mod cannot pin, one version each, read by
# the Makefile (include), scripts/ensure-tools.sh (source) and the workflows
# ($GITHUB_ENV). The Go toolchain is go.mod's `toolchain` line, and golangci-lint and
# govulncheck are go.mod tools. markdownlint-cli2 is locked by
# tools/markdownlint/package-lock.json.
#
# Plain NAME=value lines only: make and bash both read this file. A bump changes the
# version and every checksum (scripts/pinned-tools.sh reports what is behind; the
# checksums come from each release's own checksum file).

GORELEASER_VERSION=2.18.2
GORELEASER_SHA256_linux_amd64=0a96edc9d9bc594e4a41cc4d59467c182062910ab24d9d1f6dd7b667d32606d3
